direction: down

buffer: Your unsaved .tsrx buffer
framework: Framework extension keeps the language
official: Official OXC VS Code extension
mux: oxc-tsrx LSP multiplexer
server: oxc-tsrx-lsp native server
canonical: Canonical Oxlint for JS and TS
oxc: Native OXC lint and format for TSRX
tsgo: Opt-in TypeScript-Go process
diagnostics: Squiggles on your authored bytes
edits: Validated formatting and quick fixes

framework -> buffer
buffer -> official
official -> mux
mux -> canonical
mux -> server
server -> oxc
canonical -> diagnostics
oxc -> diagnostics
oxc -> edits
server -> tsgo
tsgo -> diagnostics
